        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFor Sale by DNG Online Auction TO REGISTER FOR OUR ONLINE AUCTION on the 3rd December 2026 at 2pm.Visit www.dngauctions.ieChoose/ Search for your property of interest, click log in & register to bid and follow the necessary steps.Bidder security required prior to auction date in order to successfully bid on the day.DNG Martin O'Connor Land Sales are delighted to offer for sale by DNG Online Auction this conveniently positioned parcel of land at Rusheeny, Oughterard, Co. Galway.The property comprises Plot 3, shown hatched in cyan, forming part of a proposed subdivision of File Plan 80 of Folio GY4010F and extending to approximately 1.92 Ha (4.73 acres).The lands are situated close to Oughterard Village and benefit from road frontage on two sides. The property comprises good-quality grazing land which, with further improvement, would make a useful standalone holding.Its location and extensive road frontage may also offer potential for the provision of a site, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission and all relevant consents.A particularly appealing parcel for adjoining landowners, farmers or purchasers seeking land within easy reach of Oughterard Village.\n\nPlease note this property will be offered by online auction (unless sold prior). Vendors may decide to accept pre-auction bids so please register your interest with us to avoid disappointment. The successful bidder is required to pay the balance of 10% deposit and contracts are signed immediately on acceptance of a bid.Directions: From Oughterard village proceed along Main Street towards Clifden passing the Garda Station on your left. Just before the Bridge turn left at McNamaras Shop & the Beauty House salon it will be signposted Costelloe and Shannapheasteen. Drive out this road past the Oughterard Motors and take the next right turn onto the Rusheeny Road. Driving for about half a mile turn left a stone built shed with a green roof directly after Eircode H91H9WX . Lot 3 is located on the right hand side fronting onto two roads."
      },
